# Testing gate (FE)

Before marking UI work **Done**:

1. Follow [docs/TESTING.md](docs/TESTING.md).
2. Run production **build** for the touched app.
3. **Browser** verify primary path (start local servers if needed).
4. Use skill `.cursor/skills/mealhq-ui-screen/SKILL.md`.
5. Report build + browser results; close session tabs when finished.
